ors, even retail shoppers.  Oh what fun!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3777196740904226161/comments/default/7454204088500010637'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3777196740904226161/comments/default/7454204088500010637'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/to-protect-and-sue.html?showComment=1192234080000#c7454204088500010637' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/to-protect-and-sue.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3777196740904226161' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3777196740904226161' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 12, 2007 at 6:08 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7849026850537772543</id><published>2007-10-12T17:39:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-12T17:39:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Enough already! I can&#39;t take it anymore.I need pra...</title><content type='html'>Enough already! I can&#39;t take it anymore.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I need practical strategic advice  about how to disband police departments, and move to an all-volunteer civilian response network.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3777196740904226161/comments/default/7849026850537772543'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3777196740904226161/comments/default/7849026850537772543'/><link rel='alternate' type=